---
import PageShell from '../layouts/PageShell.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<PageShell
  title="Cookie Policy | Tourvir Sri Lanka"
  description="Learn how Tourvir uses essential and optional analytics cookies, how consent works, and how you can manage or disable cookies in your browser."
  pageStyles={["css/pages/contact.css"]}
  activeRoute=""
  image="/images/gallery/beach.webp"
  imageAlt="Sri Lankan beach featured by Tourvir"
>
<main class="main-content" id="main-content">
      <section class="page-hero legacy-util-11">
        <div class="page-hero__bg">
          <img loading="lazy" src="images/gallery/beach.webp" alt="Sri Lanka">
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero__overlay"></div>
        <div class="page-hero__content">
          <h1 class="page-hero__title">Cookie Policy</h1>
          <Breadcrumbs items={[
            { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
            { name: 'Cookie Policy', href: '/cookies.html' },
          ]} />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container legacy-util-12">

          <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
          <p>As is common practice with almost all professional websites, this site uses cookies, which are tiny files that are downloaded to your computer, to improve your experience.</p>
          
          <h2>2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
          <p>We use cookies for a variety of reasons detailed below. Unfortunately, in most cases, there are no industry standard options for disabling cookies without completely disabling the functionality and features they add to this site.</p>
          
          <h2>3. Disabling Cookies</h2>
          <p>You can prevent the setting of cookies by adjusting the settings on your browser. Be aware that disabling cookies will affect the functionality of this and many other websites that you visit.</p>
          
          <h2>4. The Cookies We Set</h2>
          <p>If you create an account with us or submit data through a form such as those found on contact pages, cookies may be set to remember your user details for future correspondence.</p>
          
          <h2>5. Third Party Cookies</h2>
          <p>Google Analytics is offered as an optional third-party analytics service to help us understand how visitors use the site and how we can improve it. Google Analytics is not loaded unless you select “Accept analytics” in the cookie preference notice. Your choice is stored in your browser's local storage and can be reset by clearing this site's stored data.</p>

        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    
</PageShell>
